,"appCategories":[],"industries":[],"languages":[],"largeThumbnail":null,"banner":null,"screenshots":[],"listed":false,"numComments":0,"numRatings":0,"avgRating":0,"numViews":81,"scoreCompleteness":60,"groupDesignations":null,"apiToken1ExpirationDate":-1,"apiToken2ExpirationDate":-1,"lastViewed":1791846000000,"source":"U.S. Energy Information Administration"},{"id":"f2f95edeb04d48f58ee267f035682103","owner":"EIA.gov","created":1692050476000,"modified":1692050583000,"guid":null,"name":null,"title":"Residential Energy Consumption Survey Dashboard","type":"Document Link","typeKeywords":["Data","Document"],"description":"<p>We periodically conduct the <a href='https://www.eia.gov/consumption/residential' rel='nofollow ugc'><i>Residential Energy Consumption Survey (RECS)<\/i><\/a>, which provides detailed estimates of energy usage in U.S. homes. This dashboard includes selected residential energy site consumption, expenditures, and household characteristics information from the <a href='https://www.eia.gov/consumption/residential/data/2020/' rel='nofollow ugc'><i>2020 RECS<\/i><\/a>, the 15<sup>th<\/sup> iteration of the survey.<\/p><p>You can find additional information about the <i>2020 RECS<\/i>, including <a href='https://www.eia.gov/consumption/residential/terminology.cfm' rel='nofollow ugc'>terminology<\/a>, <a href='https://www.eia.gov/consumption/residential/data/2020/index.php?view=methodology' rel='nofollow ugc'>methodology<\/a>, <a href='https://www.eia.gov/consumption/residential/data/2020/index.php?view=microdata' rel='nofollow ugc'>microdata file<\/a>, and <a href='https://www.eia.gov/consumption/residential/data/2020/index.php?view=state' rel='nofollow ugc'>data tables<\/a>, on our website.<\/p><p>Estimates and relative standard error values are available in the <a href='https://www.eia.gov/consumption/residential/data/2020/index.php?view=state#hc' rel='nofollow ugc'>state data tables<\/a>. Perceived differences between the estimates displayed in the bar chart may not be statistically significant.<\/p><p>Notes: Some estimates are not available for all states (<i>Data withheld<\/i>) because either the relative standard error (RSE) was greater than 50% or there were fewer than 10 households in the reporting sample. These are identified as \u201cQ\u201d or \u201cN\u201d in the <a href='https://www.eia.gov/consumption/residential/data/2020/index.php?view=state#hc' rel='nofollow ugc'><i>RECS<\/i> data tables<\/a>. Exercise caution when deriving withheld estimates from published estimates.<\/p><p>Data source: U.S. Energy Information Administration, Office of Energy Demand and Integrated Statistics, <i>2020 Residential Energy Consumption Survey<\/i><\/p>","tags":[],"snippet":"With selected residential energy site consumption, expenditures, and household characteristics from the 2020 RECS","thumbnail":"thumbnail/thumbnail1692050506631.png","documentation":null,"extent":[],"categories":[],"spatialReference":null,"accessInformation":null,"classification":null,"licenseInfo":null,"culture":"en-us","properties":null,"advancedSettings":null,"url":"https://experience.arcgis.com/experience/cbf6875974554a74823232f84f563253","proxyFilter":null,"access":"public","size":-1,"subInfo":0,"appCategories":[],"industries":[],"languages":[],"largeThumbnail":null,"banner":null,"screenshots":[],"listed":false,"numComments":0,"numRatings":0,"avgRating":0,"numViews":41,"scoreCompleteness":66,"groupDesignations":null,"apiToken1ExpirationDate":-1,"apiToken2ExpirationDate":-1,"lastViewed":1792094400000,"source":"U.S. Energy Information Administration"},{"id":"8f60dba095434524b62b2b4b402e4703","owner":"Kenny.Lohr_eia","created":1671546575000,"modified":1671548059000,"guid":null,"name":"Energy_Resources_GettyImages-1138600594-sm.jpg","title":"Oil Platform and Wind Turbines over Water","type":"Image","typeKeywords":["Data","Image","jpg"],"description":null,"tags":[],"snippet":null,"thumbnail":null,"documentation":null,"extent":[],"categories":[],"spatialReference":null,"accessInformation":"Getty Images","classification":null,"licenseInfo":null,"culture":"en-us","properties":null,"advancedSettings":null,"url":null,"proxyFilter":null,"access":"public","size":-1,"subInfo":0,"appCategories":[],"industries":[],"languages":[],"largeThumbnail":null,"banner":null,"screenshots":[],"listed":false,"numComments":0,"numRatings":0,"avgRating":0,"numViews":84,"scoreCompleteness":33,"groupDesignations":null,"apiToken1ExpirationDate":-1,"apiToken2ExpirationDate":-1,"lastViewed":1790024400000,"source":"U.S. Energy Information Administration"},{"id":"f06bec08d6c440d0b7438718e66f4c8f","owner":"Kenny.Lohr_eia","created":1671568225000,"modified":1671568225000,"guid":null,"name":"nasa-Q1p7bh3SHj8-unsplash_1600px.jpg","title":"nasa_earth","type":"Image","typeKeywords":["Data","Image","jpg"],"description":null,"tags":[],"snippet":null,"thumbnail":null,"documentation":null,"extent":[],"categories":[],"spatialReference":null,"accessInformation":null,"classification":null,"licenseInfo":null,"culture":"en-us","properties":null,"advancedSettings":null,"url":null,"proxyFilter":null,"access":"public","size":-1,"subInfo":0,"appCategories":[],"industries":[],"languages":[],"largeThumbnail":null,"banner":null,"screenshots":[],"listed":false,"numComments":0,"numRatings":0,"avgRating":0,"numViews":93,"scoreCompleteness":33,"groupDesignations":null,"apiToken1ExpirationDate":-1,"apiToken2ExpirationDate":-1,"lastViewed":1790024400000,"source":"U.S. Energy Information Administration"},{"id":"67c62bb9557c4bedb0528008c88203c3","owner":"Kenny.Lohr_eia","created":1671549899000,"modified":1671549899000,"guid":null,"name":"eia_logo.png","title":"eia_logo","type":"Image","typeKeywords":["Data","Image","png"],"description":null,"tags":[],"snippet":null,"thumbnail":null,"documentation":null,"extent":[],"categories":[],"spatialReference":null,"accessInformation":null,"classification":null,"licenseInfo":null,"culture":"en-us","properties":null,"advancedSettings":null,"url":null,"proxyFilter":null,"access":"public","size":-1,"subInfo":0,"appCategories":[],"industries":[],"languages":[],"largeThumbnail":null,"banner":null,"screenshots":[],"listed":false,"numComments":0,"numRatings":0,"avgRating":0,"numViews":53509,"scoreCompleteness":33,"groupDesignations":null,"apiToken1ExpirationDate":-1,"apiToken2ExpirationDate":-1,"lastViewed":1789592400000,"source":"U.S. Energy Information Administration"},{"id":"368df241c3c84592acb4531385d48b89","owner":"EIA.gov","created":1688153365000,"modified":1689863206000,"guid":null,"name":null,"title":"RECS-maps","type":"Web Experience","typeKeywords":["EXB Experience","JavaScript","publishVersion:1.12.0","Ready To Use","status: Published","version:1.12.0","Web Application","Web Experience","Web Mapping Application","Web Page","Web Site"],"description":"<p>We periodically conduct the <a href='https://www.eia.gov/consumption/residential' rel='nofollow ugc'><i>Residential Energy Consumption Survey (RECS)<\/i><\/a>, which provides detailed estimates of energy usage in U.S. homes. This dashboard includes selected residential energy site consumption, expenditures, and household characteristics information from the <a href='https://www.eia.gov/consumption/residential/data/2020/' rel='nofollow ugc'><i>2020 RECS<\/i><\/a>, the 15<sup>th<\/sup> iteration of the survey.<\/p>\n<p>You can find additional information about the <i>2020 RECS<\/i>, including <a href='https://www.eia.gov/consumption/residential/terminology.cfm' rel='nofollow ugc'>terminology<\/a>, <a href='https://www.eia.gov/consumption/residential/data/2020/index.php?view=methodology' rel='nofollow ugc'>methodology<\/a>,\n<a href='https://www.eia.gov/consumption/residential/data/2020/index.php?view=microdata' rel='nofollow ugc'>microdata\nfile<\/a><span>,<\/span> and <a href='https://www.eia.gov/consumption/residential/data/2020/index.php?view=state' rel='nofollow ugc'>data\ntables<\/a>, on our website.<\/p>\n<p>Estimates and relative standard error values are available in the <a href='https://www.eia.gov/consumption/residential/data/2020/index.php?view=state#hc' rel='nofollow ugc'>state data tables<\/a>. Perceived differences between the estimates displayed in the bar chart may not be statistically significant.<\/p>\n<p>Notes: Some estimates are not available for all states (<i>Data withheld<\/i>) because either the relative\nstandard error (RSE) was greater than 50% or there were fewer than 10 households in the reporting sample. These are identified as \u201cQ\u201d or \u201cN\u201d in the <a href='https://www.eia.gov/consumption/residential/data/2020/index.php?view=state#hc' rel='nofollow ugc'><i>RECS<\/i>\ndata tables<\/a>. Exercise caution when deriving withheld estimates from published estimates.<\/p>\n<p>Data source: U.S. Energy Information Administration, Office of Energy Demand and Integrated Statistics, <i>2020\nResidential Energy Consumption Survey<\/i><\/p>","tags":[],"snippet":"Contains map pages for embedment in RECS Dashboard.  These data include selected residential energy site consumption, expenditures and household characteristics information from the 2020 Residential Energy Consumption Survey (RECS).","thumbnail":"thumbnail/blob.png","documentation":null,"extent":[],"categories":[],"spatialReference":null,"accessInformation":"U.S. Energy Information Administration","classification":null,"licenseInfo":null,"culture":"en-us","properties":null,"advancedSettings":null,"url":"https://experience.arcgis.com/experience/368df241c3c84592acb4531385d48b89/","proxyFilter":null,"access":"public","size":-1,"subInfo":0,"appCategories":[],"industries":[],"languages":[],"largeThumbnail":null,"banner":null,"screenshots":[],"listed":false,"numComments":0,"numRatings":0,"avgRating":0,"numViews":176769,"scoreCompleteness":50,"groupDesignations":null,"apiToken1ExpirationDate":-1,"apiToken2ExpirationDate":-1,"lastViewed":1792386000000,"source":"U.S. Energy Information Administration"},{"id":"de68af2c3633467fb0fdec160069c511","owner":"EIA.gov","created":1603485180000,"modified":1627312144000,"guid":null,"name":"survey123_2a5a62160bbf466d976aa1bd4a06eb9e_fieldworker","title":"U.S. Energy Atlas Feedback Survey Inputs (System File)","type":"Feature Service","typeKeywords":["2a5a62160bbf466d976aa1bd4a06eb9e","ArcGIS Server","Data","Feature Access","Feature Service","FieldworkerView","Public Data Collection","Service","Singlelayer","Survey123","Survey123 Hub","Hosted Service","View Service"],"description":null,"tags":[],"snippet":null,"thumbnail":"thumbnail/ago_downloaded.png","documentation":null,"extent":[[-180,-90],[180,90]],"categories":[],"spatialReference":"4326","accessInformation":null,"classification":null,"licenseInfo":null,"culture":"en-us","properties":null,"advancedSettings":null,"url":"https://services7.arcgis.com/FGr1D95XCGALKXqM/arcgis/rest/services/survey123_2a5a62160bbf466d976aa1bd4a06eb9e_fieldworker/FeatureServer","proxyFilter":null,"access":"public","size":-1,"subInfo":0,"appCategories":[],"industries":[],"languages":[],"largeThumbnail":null,"banner":null,"screenshots":[],"listed":false,"numComments":0,"numRatings":0,"avgRating":0,"numViews":1917,"scoreCompleteness":33,"groupDesignations":null,"apiToken1ExpirationDate":-1,"apiToken2ExpirationDate":-1,"lastViewed":1792382400000,"source":"U.S. Energy Information Administration"},{"id":"cbf6875974554a74823232f84f563253","owner":"EIA.gov","created":1683647921000,"modified":1782828800000,"guid":null,"name":null,"title":"Residential Energy Consumption Survey Dashboard","type":"Web Experience","typeKeywords":["EXB Experience","JavaScript","lastEditor:Kenny.Lohr_eia","modified: 1782828180885","publishVersion:1.12.0","Ready To Use","status: Published","template:blankfullscreen","version:1.21.0","Web Application","Web Experience","Web Mapping Application","Web Page","Web Site"],"description":"<p>We periodically conduct the <a href='https://www.eia.gov/consumption/residential' rel='nofollow ugc'><i>Residential Energy Consumption Survey (RECS)<\/i><\/a>, which provides detailed estimates of energy usage in U.S. homes. This dashboard includes selected residential energy site consumption, expenditures, and household characteristics information from the <a href='https://www.eia.gov/consumption/residential/data/2020/' rel='nofollow ugc'><i>2020 RECS<\/i><\/a>, the 15<sup>th<\/sup> iteration of the survey.<\/p>\n<p>You can find additional information about the <i>2020 RECS<\/i>, including <a href='https://www.eia.gov/consumption/residential/terminology.cfm' rel='nofollow ugc'>terminology<\/a>, <a href='https://www.eia.gov/consumption/residential/data/2020/index.php?view=methodology' rel='nofollow ugc'>methodology<\/a>,\n<a href='https://www.eia.gov/consumption/residential/data/2020/index.php?view=microdata' rel='nofollow ugc'>microdata\nfile<\/a><span>,<\/span> and <a href='https://www.eia.gov/consumption/residential/data/2020/index.php?view=state' rel='nofollow ugc'>data\ntables<\/a>, on our website.<\/p>\n<p>Estimates and relative standard error values are available in the <a href='https://www.eia.gov/consumption/residential/data/2020/index.php?view=state#hc' rel='nofollow ugc'>state data tables<\/a>. Perceived differences between the estimates displayed in the bar chart may not be statistically significant.<\/p>\n<p>Notes: Some estimates are not available for all states (<i>Data withheld<\/i>) because either the relative\nstandard error (RSE) was greater than 50% or there were fewer than 10 households in the reporting sample. These are identified as \u201cQ\u201d or \u201cN\u201d in the <a href='https://www.eia.gov/consumption/residential/data/2020/index.php?view=state#hc' rel='nofollow ugc'><i>RECS<\/i>\ndata tables<\/a>. Exercise caution when deriving withheld estimates from published estimates.<\/p>\n<p>Data source: U.S. Energy Information Administration, Office of Energy Demand and Integrated Statistics, <i>2020\nResidential Energy Consumption Survey<\/i><\/p>","tags":[],"snippet":"With selected residential energy site consumption, expenditures, and household characteristics from the 2020 RECS","thumbnail":"thumbnail/Residential_Energy_Consumption_Survey_Dashboard.png","documentation":null,"extent":[],"categories":[],"spatialReference":null,"accessInformation":"U.S. Energy Information Administration","classification":null,"licenseInfo":null,"culture":"en-us","properties":null,"advancedSettings":null,"url":"https://experience.arcgis.com/experience/cbf6875974554a74823232f84f563253","proxyFilter":null,"access":"public","size":-1,"subInfo":0,"appCategories":[],"industries":[],"languages":[],"largeThumbnail":null,"banner":null,"screenshots":[],"listed":false,"numComments":0,"numRatings":0,"avgRating":0,"numViews":79044,"scoreCompleteness":66,"groupDesignations":null,"apiToken1ExpirationDate":-1,"apiToken2ExpirationDate":-1,"lastViewed":1792386000000,"source":"U.S. Energy Information Administration"}]}